<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-17T14:45:01.516Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:45:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis now hold the Bab al-Mandeb strait and surrounding positions after Yemeni government forces withdrew, securing the key maritime chokepoint. Saudi Arabia has dismissed its anti-Houthi coalition commander as rebels push toward Aden, now within about 60 km of the city, while coalition units have retreated from several key areas. The Houthis repelled coalition missile and drone interceptions and killed a senior Yemeni military commander in Al-Jawf. Japan's ONE shipping group transited the Red Sea choke point for the first time in three years, indicating limited commercial traffic. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/15/world/middleeast/saudi-houthis-yemen-red-sea.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261117-saudi-arabia-replaces-military-commander-after-yemen-setbacks&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5ad2QyN04ybElkdHdXZTBxc0NuZV9vZEtlcFFZX2NpWUhvLUxmWVViZDQ5eXUtLUxJNDhBV3FxbnQxYkdhS1JIcVJrX1VnZ0lRQ1UzQTdVamJfLWdYSHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/16/saudi-arabia-challenged-yemeni-allies-ceding-ground-houthis&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPT3NjbXV1cHI4cUZiNmJmR0FscFVPTEVUR3FMVTN2Vk5UNXZmNWNMbTFxdDF1ZWYzQU16M0hCQ29aYXZScUlHUzJVSGJ2aVA2QmdsdmpBSWF6eFBvX1VwVEZOWmJaUEFUWUNSNHhHMWQ3QldPekUzc